Subject: count files the VMS layer left out as a partial transfer

When vms/vms_at.c has to leave a received file out (a name that differs
from another only in case, which on VMS is the same file), it says so and
the transfer goes on; the exit status is then 23, as for any file not
transferred.

--- a/client.c	2026-11-06 20:24:13.056127355 +0000
+++ b/client.c	2026-11-06 20:24:13.141880879 +0000
@@ -230,7 +230,12 @@
 		assert((ssize_t)sess.total_deleted >= sess.opts->max_delete ||
 		    sess.opts->dry_run);
 		rc = ERR_DEL_LIMIT;
+#ifdef __VMS
+	/* files the VMS layer had to leave out (vms/vms_at.c) */
+	} else if (sess.total_errors > 0 || vms_soft_errors > 0)
+#else
 	} else if (sess.total_errors > 0)
+#endif
 		rc = ERR_PARTIAL;
 out:
 	sess_cleanup(&sess);
